    "name": {
      "value": "Wand of Toxic Blades (8Th-Level Spell)"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "tv"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "This slender metal wand is tinted green and small images of bladed weapons are etched on its surface. You cast blade barrier of the indicated level. Damage from the wall also exposes the damaged creature to a poison determined by the wand's type. The poison uses its normal DC. A creature can be exposed to the poison no more than once per turn. The poison is cerulean scourge (Advanced Player's Guide 254)."
    },
